      "id": "claim_4a04e0315d0a49f384687e0bae5d0087",
      "statement": "As an alternative to environment variables, many cloud platforms now allow you to map configuration into mounted data volumes. For example, Kubernetes can volume mount both ConfigMaps and Secrets.",
